{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":81615,"duration_api_ms":102325,"num_turns":14,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"ded0f704-8c44-4366-8525-b027721d4d99","total_cost_usd":0.72108185,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":57692,"cache_read_input_tokens":449043,"output_tokens":3004,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":57692,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":39,"outputTokens":2732,"cacheReadInputTokens":113026,"cacheCreationInputTokens":28671,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.06084035,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":9,"outputTokens":3004,"cacheReadInputTokens":449043,"cacheCreationInputTokens":57692,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.6602415,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 185 tank_core tests pass with 0 failures across 22 test binaries (lib + 19 integration suites). All 17 tank_data+tank_scenarios tests pass. cargo clippy -D warnings and cargo fmt --check both pass clean.","shrimp_feeding (shrimp.rs:126-172) now bounds total intake to a single daily grazing budget: periphyton is consumed first (line 144), and detritus only fills the remainder (line 152: `detritus_demand = (food_demand - periph_consumed).max(0.0)`). The prior double-counting bug where both pools independently consumed at the full rate is fixed.","route_consumed_food (shrimp.rs:188-262) correctly partitions consumed N+C through all five named pathways: feces→fine_detritus_g_total (lines 201-206), excreted N→TAN+alkalinity (lines 215-217), excreted C→DOC (lines 220-221), respired C→DIC+O2 demand with DO-limited scaling (lines 228-243), respired N→TAN+alkalinity (lines 246-251), and retained→reserve_g (lines 257-261).","Alkalinity coupling implemented correctly: both excretion (line 217) and respiration (line 251) TAN releases credit alkalinity_meq_total via division by MG_N_PER_MEQ_AMMONIA.","migrate_v3_to_v4 (save.rs:333-372) now seeds reserve_g from existing shrimp biomass: `reserve_g = (adults * ADULT_BIOMASS + juveniles * JUVENILE_BIOMASS) * LIVE_BIOMASS_ORGANIC_FRACTION`. Includes idempotency guard (line 335), proper error handling for missing/invalid counts, and u32 overflow checks.","Conservation tests pass: closed_system_shrimp_feeding_conserves_nitrogen, closed_system_shrimp_feeding_conserves_carbon, test_closed_system_n_conservation, test_closed_system_c_conservation, test_closed_system_shrimp_mortality_conserves_n_and_c, test_closed_system_shrimp_reproduction_conserves_n_and_c — all with multi-day closed-system runs.","Key regression tests cover all addressed amendments: shrimp_feeding_uses_detritus_only_for_unmet_demand (bounded demand), oxygen_limited_respiration_scales_dissolved_fluxes_and_retains_shortfall (DO scaling), legacy_schema_v3_saves_seed_reserve_from_existing_shrimp_biomass (migration), step_daily_shrimp_refreshes_carbonate_before_condition (pH refresh ordering).","All five named parameters (shrimp_assimilation_efficiency, respiration/excretion/growth fractions, o2_per_mg_c_respired) are defined in default.toml, validated at startup via invariant checks and preset validation, and documented in ROUTING.md with parameter table.","Phase-1 simplifications explicitly documented: shared food quality (shrimp.rs:158-162), unbounded reserve accumulation (shrimp.rs:253-256), and lumped TAN+DOC excretion (ROUTING.md:160)."],"findings_or_gaps":["All four acceptance criteria are met: (1) consumed mass partitioned into assimilated+fecal within tolerance, (2) TAN/DIC/O2/detritus generated proportional to feeding, (3) named parameters control all fractions with simplifications documented, (4) conservation tests confirm N and C preserved.","Both final-review amendments from round 4 have been implemented: v3→v4 migration now seeds reserve from population biomass instead of defaulting to 0; shrimp feeding now bounds total intake to one daily grazing budget instead of double-counting periphyton and detritus demands.","No regressions detected. The previously noted pre-existing filter_enabled_vs_disabled failure now passes cleanly."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"96d6d8f5-9ef8-47ba-85dc-91a938f55ce6"}
